Cloud Calc World Clock data (#1423)

land.json - Natural Earth 1:110m physical land (ne_110m_land), https://www.naturalearthdata.com,
via https://github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector. Natural Earth is in the PUBLIC DOMAIN:
"All versions of Natural Earth raster + vector map data found on this website are in the public
domain. You may use the maps in any manner, including modifying the content and design,
electronic dissemination, and offset printing." (naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use)
Converted to flat outer-ring arrays rounded to 0.1 degree by ac_cloud-calc/data/gen/worldclock.py.

cities.json - city names, coordinates, country codes and time zones from GeoNames
(https://www.geonames.org, cities500.txt and countryInfo.txt), licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Selected (capitals and the most populous cities
of the big countries) and reformatted by ac_cloud-calc/data/gen/worldclock.py; the zones list is
the IANA time zone database (public domain).
